      "writtenOn": "2026-10-12T08:58:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There should be probably a more complex synchronization method e.g.\n```\nT1:\n-\u003e enable fast CPU\n-\u003e run calculations\n  -\u003e Interrupt\n  -\u003e re-schedule to T2:\n  -\u003e enable fast CPU (already done\n  -\u003e calculations \n  -\u003e disable fast CPU\n  -\u003e reschedule to T1 again\n-\u003e continues calculations without fast CPU\n-\u003e disable fast CPU (already done)\n```",
      "revId": "78e0bae21a391309e4c28734d284fdecda4eaca8",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
